{"find": "two of the oldest of their party to take the lead. They came towards us, more shamefaced-looking than defiant, and some I noticed were grinning in the background; but forming in a semicircle around us, they all put up their hands in a prayer-like attitude, and waited for us to give them leave to speak.\n\n[[image: sketch of a figure in a turban seen from behind, sitting alone on a rock]]", "replace": "two of the oldest\n\n[[image: sketch of a figure in a turban seen from behind, sitting alone on a rock]]\n\n[[cont]]of their party to take the lead. They came towards us, more shamefaced-looking than defiant, and some I noticed were grinning in the background; but forming in a semi-circle around us, they all put up their hands in a prayer-like attitude, and waited for us to give them leave to speak."}